# Evidence output
AI agents must return structured artifacts, not only prose.
For each unit record:
- unit_id
- source_text_sha256
- model/session identifier
- Finnish candidate or review outcome
- concise decision note (not private chain-of-thought)
- explicit uncertainty / issue flags
- terminology decisions or unresolved terms
Do not discard rejected candidates; retain them for auditability.
